=== PARITY (vs web MotorHistoryWidget.tsx) ===
  Data sources → bound via the shared state-holder seam (MotorHistorySource → MotorHistoryModel):
    useMotorHistory, useVehicles, useUnits, useDateFormat, useTranslation. Production wires
