    hex: torque #06b6d4→chartSeriesRegen, stator #f97316→chartSeriesEnergy, danger #ef4444→
    statusDanger, lateralG #a78bfa→chartSeriesPower, longG #34d399→chartSeriesBattery.
  States (all render) → loading (skeleton chrome) · empty ("No motor history" + Cog) · error
    (retry) · stale (chip + banner, cached chart stays) · offline (chip + banner, cached chart) ·
    content. Model phase resolution keeps cached values visible behind refresh/errors, matching
    the web shell (which never hides the chart on background error).
